      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu kuhusu Israeli. Mwenyezi-Mungu aliyezitandaza mbingu, aliyeiweka misingi ya dunia na kumpa mwanadamu uhai asema hivi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nitaufanya mji wa Yerusalemu kuwa kama kikombe cha divai; na mataifa yaliyo kandokando yake yatakunywa na kuyumbayumba kama walevi. Mji wa Yerusalemu utakaposhambuliwa, hata miji yote ya Yuda itashambuliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo nitaufanya mji wa Yerusalemu kuwa kama jiwe zito kwa watu wote: Yeyote atakayelinyanyua atajiumiza mwenyewe. Watu wa mataifa yote duniani wataushambulia mji huo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, nasema mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu, nitamtia hofu kila farasi, na mpandafarasi wake nitamfanya kuwa mwendawazimu. Farasi wa mataifa mengine nitawapofusha. Lakini kabila la Yuda nitalilinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo viongozi wa Yuda watakapoambiana, ‘Wakazi wa Yerusalemu wamepata nguvu yao kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wao’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku hiyo, viongozi wa Yuda nitawafanya kama chungu cha moto mkali katika msitu; naam, kama mwenge uwakao kati ya miganda. Watayateketeza mataifa yote yaliyo kandokando yao. Lakini watu wa Yerusalemu wataendelea kuishi salama katika mji wao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nami Mwenyezi-Mungu nitawasaidia kwanza jamaa za Yuda kusudi wazawa wa Daudi na wakazi wa Yerusalemu wasijione kuwa maarufu zaidi ya watu wengine wa kabila la Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nitawalinda wakazi wa mji wa Yerusalemu; walio wanyonge zaidi miongoni mwao watakuwa na nguvu kama mfalme Daudi. Wazawa wa Daudi watashika usukani kuwaongoza watu wa Yuda kama malaika wangu mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu, naam, kama mimi Mungu mwenyewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku hiyo, nitayaangamiza mataifa yote yanayotaka kuushambulia mji wa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazawa wa Daudi na wakazi wa mji wa Yerusalemu nitawajaza roho ya huruma na maombi, nao watamtazama yeye waliyemtoboa; watamlilia kama mtu amliliavyo mtoto wake wa pekee, au kama mtu amliliavyo kwa uchungu mzaliwa wake wa kwanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo kutakuwa na maombolezo makuu mjini Yerusalemu kama maombolezo ya kumwombolezea Hadad-rimoni katika mbuga za Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchi itaomboleza, kila ukoo utaomboleza peke yake, wanaume peke yao na wanawake peke yao; ukoo wa Daudi peke yake; ukoo wa Nathani peke yake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukoo wa Lawi peke yake na ukoo wa Shimei peke yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jamaa zote zilizosalia zitaomboleza; wanaume peke yao na wanawake peke yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
